At the owner's request, the Unreleased section goes from 1,612 words
(16.6 per commit over the 97 non-tracker commits since v9.2.0) to 897
(9.2 per commit), in line with 9.2.0 (10.2) and 9.1.0 (9.2).

Each entry states its effect in one sentence. What is kept: every ADR
reference, version transition (stable_id_scheme v9 -> v13, SCHEMA_VERSION
0.20.15 -> 0.21.0, io-boundaries 2.4 -> 2.5), the one consumer action
(expand a module-set handle before splitting on commas), and one
measurement per large fix (apollo-server, django, nest). Fixed's eleven
subsections are folded into seven. No entry is dropped, and no released
section is touched.

